  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.stratiotes.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.stratiotes.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.stratiotes.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_stratiotes"><head>ΣΤΡΑΤΙΩΤΗΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l1">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> Ἀπόλαβε.</sp>
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Β.</speaker> τοῦτο δ᾿ ἐστὶ τί;</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l2">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> * * * * ὃ παρ᾿ ὑμῶν ἐγὼ</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l3">παιδάριον ἔλαβον, ἀποφέρων ἥκω πάλιν.</l>
                  <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l4">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Β.</speaker> πῶς; οὐκ ἀρέσκει σοι τρέφειν;</sp>
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> οὐκ ἔστι γάρ</sp>
                  </l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <pb n="479" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:485" />
              <sp>
                <speaker>Α</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l5">ἡμέτερον.</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Β</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l6">οὐδ᾽ ἡμέτερον.</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Α</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="7" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l7">ἀλλ᾽ ἐδώκατε</l>
                  <l n="8" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l8">ὑμεῖς ἐμοὶ τοῦτ᾽.</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Β</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="9" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l9">οὐ δεδώκαμεν.</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Α</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="10" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l10">τί δαί;</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Β</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="11" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l11">ἀπεδώκαμεν.</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <sp>
                <speaker>Α</speaker>
                <lg>
                  <l n="12" xml:id="meineke-0402-stratiotes-1-l12">τὸ μὴ προσῆκον ἐμοὶ λαβεῖν;</l>
                </lg>
              </sp>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus VI p. 223 e. de Demosthenis dicto ad taedium usque inculcato agens, <quote>ὃς Φιλίππου Ἀθηναίοις Ἁλόννησον διδόντος συνεβούλευε μὴ λαμβάνειν εἰ δίδωσιν ἀλλὰ μὴ ἀποδίδωσιν.</quote> — Ἄλεξις δ᾽ ἐν Στρατιώτη Ἀπόλαβε κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 ἀπόλαβε Α. ἀπέλαβες PVL. Versu secundo lacunam indicavit Dindorfius. Non male tamen Reisigius Coni. p. 49 tentabat: <quote>Ἀπόλαβε. Β. τί δὲ τοῦτ᾽ ἐστίν; Α. ὃ παρ᾽ ὑμῶν ἐγώ —</quote> Vs. 5 ὑμέτερον P. — Vs. 6 δαὶ Hermannus apud Erfurdtium Observ. p. 434. Libri δέ. — Vs. 7 ἀπεδώκαμεν pro ἀποδεδώκαμεν Casaubonus. Tum praestat, opinor, προσῆκόν μοι, vel ἐμὲ λαβεῖν;</note>
            </div>
